WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks for having me.
-It's been a while.

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
Four years ago you were here,
and you were on --

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
you and Anna Wintour came on
together.

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:08.041 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, we usually make all of
our appearances together.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:09.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, it's so strange
to see you...

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:11.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Weird to be here without her.
-Yeah, exactly.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:12.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-When you see Sarah,

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:15.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
you just expect Anna Wintour
to be right next to her.

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:17.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We vacation together.
-Of course.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.718 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's a very fun person
to spend time with.

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:21.521 size:81% position:41%
-She is. She's lovely.
-You posted something

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.123 align:start size:94% position:6%
on Instagram
I want to ask you about.

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:25.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now for those who don't know,
everyone who comes

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:27.093 align:start size:94% position:6%
on this show --
-What Instagram is?

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:29.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
-For Instagram, it's a way --
Can you explain it?

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:31.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's a neat -- it's
a sort of -- hard to explain.

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:33.900 align:start size:94% position:6%
But if there's a picture
you like...

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Mm-hmm.
-And you'd like other people

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.836 align:start size:94% position:6%
to see it and maybe they are
people you know...

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:39.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Sure.
-Or people you don't know.

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:43.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's a way...
It's a way of communicating.

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:44.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-It's a way --

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:46.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know how you used to have
to bring slides...

00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:47.547
-Right.
-...over to your friends' house.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.449
-Exactly.
And this way -- it sounds crazy.

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:53.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know it's hard to believe,
but you just...

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:55.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
you send it.
-You send it.

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:58.591
-It's the weirdest thing. And at
least a hundred people,

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:02.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
maybe more, could see...
-It's crazy.

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:03.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...what's happening
in your home.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.698
-And I was one of those hundred
on something

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:08.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
you recently posted.
-Oh, you were? Thank you.

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:09.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You posted a video of
your mugs.

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:11.504
-Yeah. I don't know why.
-Now most people would --

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:13.139 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I was drawn to this.
Because --

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:14.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was a slow news day,
much like today.

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:17.210
-Yeah. I know, that's the thing.
Remember when things were

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:20.346
so crazy that we didn't have
time to take videos of our mugs?

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:22.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh.
-But you posted your video

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:25.218 align:start size:94% position:6%
and as a guest on the show,
everyone gets a mug.

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:26.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
You get a mug.
-Yes, yes.

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:28.221
-Your husband's been on the show
three times.

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:29.522
-Yes.
-So he has -- I was very happy.

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:32.292
If we look at this mug video,
you'll see "Tonight Show."

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:35.161
You got a "Tonight Show" mug.
-Well, I'm like a mug shot.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:36.196 line:92%
-Yeah! But let's take a look,

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:38.198 size:88% position:44%
because there's a couple
"Late Night" mugs there.

00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:39.165 line:92%
Sorry, there we go. There's --

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:40.900 align:start size:94% position:6%
we're coming up on --
I think that's --

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:42.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Stuff from Moscow.
-"Tonight Show" right there.

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:43.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
Look!
-Yes.

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:45.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There's a -- right there
there's "Late Night."

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:47.107
Right in the front right.
Yep. Right down there.

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:48.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there's another one.
-I think --

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:49.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So two.
-Yes.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:52.278
-Okay, so I want to make sure
that the mugs stay in rotation,

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.848
so I personalized a mug for you.
-Oh, my God.

00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:55.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So that's us
on the show together.

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:57.183 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Audience "aw"s ]
-Aw.

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:59.686
-And then here's the date
of your two appearances.

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:01.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Oh, my God!

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:04.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know...
-Well, that's --

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:06.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Are you...Are you crying?
Oh, my God.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:09.629
I didn't think you'd cry.
-[ Voice breaks ] That's, like,

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:11.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
one of the most
sentimental things that anyone

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:13.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
has ever done for me.
-Oh, my God. That's so weird.

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:14.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hold on a second.
Hold on a second.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:16.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just talk amongst yourselves.
-Yeah.

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:18.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, that's very charming
and dear.

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:21.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, for my anniversary,
I got my wife a mug.

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:23.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The same thing?
-And she was not happy. Yeah.

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:24.277 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:25.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, was it --
was it like this?

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.180 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was the you and me mug,
yeah.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:30.450
-Oh, right, right. I understand.
Details, details.

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:35.655
Well, thank you. This is --
I will have many memorable...

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:37.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Drink, coffees?
-Um, libations.

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:39.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Libations.

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:41.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you drink a libation
in a coffee mug?

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:43.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I will now.
-Yeah, okay.

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:45.231 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I will now. And I think a lot
